sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant Q as Queue
  participant P as AI pipeline
  participant D as SQLite / files
  U->>W: capture / choose image (rotate, crop)
  W->>A: POST /api/scans (multipart, XHR progress, cancellable)
  A->>A: magic-byte check, size limit
  A->>D: store original (UUID path) + scan row (queued)
  A-->>W: 202 {id}
  A->>Q: enqueue
  loop every 700 ms
    W->>A: GET /api/scans/:id
    A-->>W: status + real stage
  end
  Q->>P: processDocument(files, options, onStage)
  P->>D: stage updates (decoding … done)
  P-->>Q: ExtractionResult + corrected pages + hashes
  Q->>D: result_json, corrected images, job_metrics
  W->>A: GET /api/scans/:id
  A-->>W: completed + result + duplicate candidates
  W-->>U: Review screen (or polite rejection)
